{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19598","headline":"立春日晓望三素云 · 李季何","name":"立春日晓望三素云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霭霭青春曙，飞仙驾五云。\n浮轮初缥缈，承盖下氤氲。\n薄影随风度，殊容向日分。\n羽毛纷共远，环佩杳犹闻。\n静合烟霞色，遥将鸾鹤羣。\n年年瞻此节，应许从元君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李季何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}